The benefit happens in a smaller space and raises less than expected. The first room remains closed for a proper repair, and the second venue is inspected before its next show. Musicians ask who covers the lost door income when a venue does the right thing by closing.','The music continued elsewhere. Who bears the cost of a responsible closure?','colony_wide',v_location,v_primary,0.95,1,60,'standard',v_facts,true,array['citywide','major-incident']::text[],'{"contentDigest":"39629fe3b2271a24134fa5b92482fd8fa9af3f2467fda9ade5278ea25121733c","pulseTier":"major"}'::jsonb) on conflict (world_id,slug) do update set content_version = excluded.content_version,title = excluded.title,feed_summary = excluded.feed_summary,detail_body = excluded.detail_body,group_message = excluded.group_message,event_type = excluded.event_type,location_id = excluded.location_id,primary_character_template_id = excluded.primary_character_template_id,significance = excluded.significance,selection_weight = excluded.selection_weight,cooldown_days = excluded.cooldown_days,content_rating = excluded.content_rating,facts = excluded.facts,active = true,tags = excluded.tags,metadata = excluded.metadata,updated_at = now() returning id into v_template;
