The exercise proceeds with a corrected list and no resident’s home treated as a public shelter. The city has to decide who maintains the map between commemorations, and the museum changes its display to distinguish historical gathering places from current emergency sites.','The exercise used a corrected list. How does a city keep emergency information from becoming history by accident?','colony_wide',v_location,v_primary,0.95,1,60,'standard',v_facts,true,array['citywide','major-incident']::text[],'{"contentDigest":"e21941065aab54c93952c08d2f362fdde3af72fd2e15e69db0e5db158ffb6e26","pulseTier":"major"}'::jsonb) on conflict (world_id,slug) do update set content_version = excluded.content_version,title = excluded.title,feed_summary = excluded.feed_summary,detail_body = excluded.detail_body,group_message = excluded.group_message,event_type = excluded.event_type,location_id = excluded.location_id,primary_character_template_id = excluded.primary_character_template_id,significance = excluded.significance,selection_weight = excluded.selection_weight,cooldown_days = excluded.cooldown_days,content_rating = excluded.content_rating,facts = excluded.facts,active = true,tags = excluded.tags,metadata = excluded.metadata,updated_at = now() returning id into v_template;
